{"id":"d5dada982b721c80","group":"20","path":"20/20-df-mred.md","title":"多一可约","display":"df-mred — 多一可约","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-df-mred","aliases":["20-df-mred"],"display":"df-mred — 多一可约","chapter":"1","section":"1.6","source_kind":"book","verification_status":"reviewed","source_reference":"Definition 1.6.8(i)","source_pdf_pages":[50],"source_printed_pages":[14],"depends_on":["[[20-df-computable]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-df-mred"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-df-mred</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-mred — 多一可约"},{"key":"chapter","html":"1"},{"key":"section","html":"1.6"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"reviewed"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Definition 1.6.8(i)"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>50</span></div>"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>14</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e343870c773cb68e\" href=\"?note=e343870c773cb68e\" title=\"20-df-computable\">20-df-computable</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\subseteq\\omega\">\\(A,B\\subseteq\\omega\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C_1^{\\mathrm{tot}}\">\\(\\mathcal C_1^{\\mathrm{tot}}\\)</span> 为全可计算一元函数族。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e343870c773cb68e\" href=\"?note=e343870c773cb68e\" title=\"20-df-computable\">20-df-computable</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}mred}\\vdash\nA\\le_m B\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\exists f\\in\\mathcal C_1^{\\mathrm{tot}}\\ \\forall x\\in\\omega\\\n[x\\in A\\Longleftrightarrow f(x)\\in B].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}mred}\\vdash\nA\\le_m B\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\exists f\\in\\mathcal C_1^{\\mathrm{tot}}\\ \\forall x\\in\\omega\\\n[x\\in A\\Longleftrightarrow f(x)\\in B].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>归约函数必须在每个输入上停止。不能用一个任意部分可计算函数代替全归约函数。</p>\n<p>来源：Definition 1.6.8(i)；印刷页 14；PDF 第 50 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"e343870c773cb68e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-computable]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"e343870c773cb68e","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-computable]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A,B\\subseteq\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal C_1^{\\mathrm{tot}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}mred}\\vdash\nA\\le_m B\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\exists f\\in\\mathcal C_1^{\\mathrm{tot}}\\ \\forall x\\in\\omega\\\n[x\\in A\\Longleftrightarrow f(x)\\in B].","display":true}],"bytes":969,"backlinks":[{"id":"d12aec25b5426f2f","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-finite-code]]；see [[20-df-computable]]；see [[20-df-truth-table]]；see [[20-df-mred]]。"},{"id":"4829719bf9cdd6dd","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-mred]]；see [[20-df-one-re